      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1764073847784,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Rest API:\nREST stands for Representational State transfer. kis format mai apka data transfer hoga.\n-> API stands for Application Programming Interface. request aur response ka data structure\nkaisa hota hai.\n-> Rest API = RESTful API\n-> REST API is define as interface that two computer system use to exchange information securely\nover the internet.\n\n-> it helps to build distributed system , apna data server par rakh denge toh waha se koi bhi acess kar \n sakta hai , access karte hai api ke through. \n\nCore principles:-\n1 Client server arichitecture :- \n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Rest API:\nREST stands for Representational State transfer. kis format mai apka data transfer hoga.\n-> API stands for Application Programming Interface. request aur response ka data structure\nkaisa hota hai.\n-> Rest API = RESTful API\n-> REST API is define as interface that two computer system use to exchange information securely\nover the internet.\n\n-> it helps to build distributed system , apna data server par rakh denge toh waha se koi bhi acess kar \n sakta hai , access karte hai api ke through. \n\nCore principles:-\n1 Client server arichitecture :- \n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
