    {
      "id": "O49f0oH_kKJmtqgQtQyWa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 463.9999694824219,
      "y": 949.0000152587891,
      "width": 857.0794067382812,
      "height": 775,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aJ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2048965717,
      "version": 1122,
      "versionNonce": 606117467,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1764075955258,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Stateless Communication : -\n     kaam se kaam rakhana type.\n\n3. Resource Based Iteraction :-\n    Routing/path based kaam karta hai\n\n4. Uniform Iterface :- type data defined hota hai \n   from client and server side. \n\n5. Cacheable :- \n\nAPI:-\n-> is set  of protocols, tools and standards that enables the communication \nb/w different software application. \n\nexample . You going for diiner in resteroent exact ordering process. \n\nStateless rest api:- jisme aapko koi data dene ki zarurat na pade like without any login,\nwant to know whather of somewhere. \n-> client specific data pr sesseion information pass nahi karni hoti hai.\n\nSateful Rest Api :- \n-> client who want to access (tokens)\n->some information  are given in token , cookies form. \n\nWhy rest Api is needed?\n-> client server interaction abhi tak koi fully replace nahi kar paya hai, widely adopted.\n\nHow rest api works?\n->\n->",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. Stateless Communication : -\n     kaam se kaam rakhana type.\n\n3. Resource Based Iteraction :-\n    Routing/path based kaam karta hai\n\n4. Uniform Iterface :- type data defined hota hai \n   from client and server side. \n\n5. Cacheable :- \n\nAPI:-\n-> is set  of protocols, tools and standards that enables the communication \nb/w different software application. \n\nexample . You going for diiner in resteroent exact ordering process. \n\nStateless rest api:- jisme aapko koi data dene ki zarurat na pade like without any login,\nwant to know whather of somewhere. \n-> client specific data pr sesseion information pass nahi karni hoti hai.\n\nSateful Rest Api :- \n-> client who want to access (tokens)\n->some information  are given in token , cookies form. \n\nWhy rest Api is needed?\n-> client server interaction abhi tak koi fully replace nahi kar paya hai, widely adopted.\n\nHow rest api works?\n->\n->",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
